g things can be  accomplished whether it's a stadium that  unites us a new job that excites us or  classroom that ignites something special  in a young child we're united in our  determination  as i said in my opening getting things  done always works best when we come  together when we put aside party labels  put down our heads and get to work  that's the true battleborn spirit that  has propelled our state forward for the  last 157 years  it is what i try to do every day as your  governor and with your help it's what  will build an even stronger nevada  thank you
 

